<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PanEnergy Corp downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PanEnergy Corp downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating on PanEnergy Corp to outperform from buy, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- PanEnergy's stock was 1/4 higher at 44 in early afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
